- 长度：20-50个字符
- 突出关键信息，提升吸引力
- 保持与原内容的准确性
{% endif %}

### 2. `brief_description` (string) 
{% if output_language and output_language.lower() in ["english", "en"] %}
- 1-2 sentence essential overview
- Length: 60-120 characters
- Summarize core value and highlights
- Help readers quickly assess reading value
{% else %}
- 1-2句话的精要概述
- 长度：60-120个字符
- 概括核心价值和亮点
- 帮助读者快速判断阅读价值
{% endif %}

### 3. `tags` (string[])
{% if output_language and output_language.lower() in ["english", "en"] %}
- Select 3~8 most relevant tags
- Avoid overly broad or narrow tags
- Truly reflect content themes and domains
- **IMPORTANT**: Generate tags in English only, matching the preset English tag list provided above
- If no suitable preset English tags exist, create new English tags that accurately describe the content
{% else %}
- 选择 3~8 个最相关的标签
